      "title": "Rules",
      "items": [
        "A route is never re-adopted under identical evidence",
        "Each new phase is judged on its own current evidence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Uncertainty",
      "items": [
        "Resolve technical uncertainty within authority: the competent specialist, or direct investigation when the user's instruction covers it, keeping effective budgets and ownership limits",
